<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb antimony exports up 21.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb antimony exports up 21.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought antimony reached 4,131 tonnes in January and February, up 21.4 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China exported a total of 2,096 tonnes of unwrought antimony in February, the figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
